    "text": "Did you know that research shows that people are more likely to set and achieve new goals when they perceive a fresh start? Events like the New Year or even just the beginning of a new week serve as psychological markers that motivate us to pursue change and self-improvement. This phenomenon is backed by studies in behavioral psychology, which suggest that these reset points can significantly boost our commitment to change.",
